{"id":"9a705a49ddc40968","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Basically Disconnected Space","display":"df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space — ZFC Topo8 Basically Disconnected Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space — ZFC Topo8 Basically Disconnected Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space — ZFC Topo8 Basically Disconnected Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,f,C,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,f,C,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a> 的唯一通常实拓扑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}basically\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\exists C\\in\\tau\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\ne0\\},C)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}basically\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\exists C\\in\\tau\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\ne0\\},C)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cozero sets are the nonzero loci of continuous real-valued functions, and\nthe canonical closure output is required to be open.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,\\tau,f,C,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V$；$\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$，使用 [[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]] 的唯一通常实拓扑。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,f,C,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}basically\\text{-}disconnected\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8BasicallyDisconnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall f\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\exists C\\in\\tau\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\ne0\\},C)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3697","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space.md|58-df-zfc-topo8-basically-disconnected-space]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","44867449c3df728b","9ac97ecaeb21258a","e7514bc4cefba4f2","3b5b3d48ff1ff369"]}